From: MilkFlint4 <builder@milkflint4>
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: motorcomm: include linux/of.h for YT8824 OF props

The YT8824 package probe uses of_property_read_string() but motorcomm.c
only includes linux/property.h. With -Werror=implicit-function-declaration
that breaks the filogic kernel build.

--- a/drivers/net/phy/motorcomm.c
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/motorcomm.c
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 #include <linux/etherdevice.h>
 #include <linux/kernel.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
+#include <linux/of.h>
 #include <linux/phy.h>
 #include <linux/property.h>
